  id: glimmerwing
  displayName: Glimmerwing
  description: Beautiful flying creature. Sky Islands' most common fauna. Source
    of feathers and a rare bioluminescent organ.
  behaviors:
  - Roosts at high altitudes.
  - Flees if approached aggressively.
  - Can be lured with food.
  - Used as a courier when tamed.
  habitat: Sky Fauna
  dropItemIds:
  - Feather x3-4
  - Bio Sac x1 (rare glow organ)
  - Raw Meat x1
